[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:04.500",
    "text": "来应宝，坐。别生气啊，好了好了好了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "安抚",
    "voice": "语速平缓，音量适中",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": "00:00:04.500",
    "end": "00:00:14.500",
    "text": "阿原，你赶紧去给我准备针灸。等那个张丽丽孩子生出来再验DNA，黄花菜都凉了。我必须早点给她扎好。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "焦急",
    "voice": "语速偏快，音量提高",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": "00:00:14.500",
    "end": "00:00:16.000",
    "text": "好的，太太。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": "00:00:16.000",
    "end": "00:00:20.000",
    "text": "",
    "speech": "",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "低沉紧张的背景音乐",
    "audio_cues": [
      "脚步声"
    ],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": "00:00:20.000",
    "end": "00:00:22.000",
    "text": "使劲扎他！使劲扎！",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "兴奋",
    "voice": "音量大，语速快",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": "00:00:22.000",
    "end": "00:00:25.500",
    "text": "哎呀好了好了，你跟他生什么气啊。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "劝解",
    "voice": "语速平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": "00:00:25.500",
    "end": "00:00:27.000",
    "text": "不生气不生气。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": "00:00:27.000",
    "end": "00:00:29.000",
    "text": "",
    "speech": "",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "叹气",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": "00:00:29.000",
    "end": "00:00:32.000",
    "text": "你没事吧？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "关切",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": "00:00:32.000",
    "end": "00:00:33.000",
    "text": "嗯。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": "00:00:33.000",
    "end": "00:00:38.000",
    "text": "你这孩子还算有点孝心。让爹帮你看看。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "语速平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": "00:00:38.000",
    "end": "00:00:41.000",
    "text": "",
    "speech": "",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [
      "重击声"
    ],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": "00:00:41.000",
    "end": "00:00:44.000",
    "text": "哎呀！你干嘛你！",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "惊讶，愤怒",
    "voice": "音量大",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": "00:00:44.000",
    "end": "00:00:46.000",
    "text": "小心应宝！",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "惊慌",
    "voice": "音量大",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": "00:00:46.000",
    "end": "00:00:50.000",
    "text": "哎呀来来来，你先坐，你先坐。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "安抚",
    "voice": "语速快",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": "00:00:50.000",
    "end": "00:00:54.000",
    "text": "没事没事啊，他是小孩，小孩，不生气啊。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "安抚",
    "voice": "语速平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": "00:00:54.000",
    "end": "00:00:56.000",
    "text": "妈妈我也是小孩啊！我也是小孩！",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "委屈",
    "voice": "音量大",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": "00:00:56.000",
    "end": "00:01:00.000",
    "text": "好好好对对对，小孩小孩，乖乖没事啊，来来来。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "安抚",
    "voice": "语速快",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": "00:01:00.000",
    "end": "00:01:07.000",
    "text": "我研究古籍，习得了一种加强针法。最多用两招就可以把老三完全治好。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "自信",
    "voice": "语速平稳，音量适中",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": "00:01:07.000",
    "end": "00:01:14.000",
    "text": "老爷子，要不别扎了吧？万一把默寒扎出问题来呢？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "担忧",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": "00:01:14.000",
    "end": "00:01:17.000",
    "text": "还能有什么问题啊？还能比现在傻吗？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "嘲讽",
    "voice": "音量提高",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": "00:01:17.000",
    "end": "00:01:24.000",
    "text": "七个小矮人变身葫芦娃，大战白雪公主。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "荒诞",
    "voice": "语速快，音量大",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [
      "卡通音效"
    ],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": "00:01:24.000",
    "end": "00:01:28.500",
    "text": "等他恢复记忆，有人要倒大霉咯。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "幸灾乐祸",
    "voice": "语调上扬",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": "00:01:28.500",
    "end": "00:01:34.000",
    "text": "四弟，你说的是谁啊？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "疑惑",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": "00:01:34.000",
    "end": "00:01:48.000",
    "text": "当然是他自己啊。三哥做了很多倒反天罡的事。爷爷等他恢复正常之后，打算好好教训他呢。不过张小姐，你以为是谁啊？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "戏谑",
    "voice": "语速平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "start": "00:01:48.000",
    "end": "00:01:52.000",
    "text": "啊，我也以为说的是他自己。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "尴尬",
    "voice": "音量降低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "start": "00:01:52.000",
    "end": "00:01:58.000",
    "text": "第一针。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "语速缓慢",
    "music": "紧张音乐响起",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "start": "00:01:58.000",
    "end": "00:02:03.000",
    "text": "",
    "speech": "",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "紧张音乐持续",
    "audio_cues": [
      "音效"
    ],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "start": "00:02:03.000",
    "end": "00:02:05.000",
    "text": "这真的有用吗这个？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "怀疑",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "start": "00:02:05.000",
    "end": "00:02:16.000",
    "text": "",
    "speech": "",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "紧张音乐持续",
    "audio_cues": [
      "心跳声"
    ],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "start": "00:02:16.000",
    "end": "00:02:18.000",
    "text": "想起来了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "音量较低",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "start": "00:02:18.000",
    "end": "00:02:21.000",
    "text": "你想起什么来了？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "惊讶",
    "voice": "音量提高",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
